Found on comp.os.vms.  Bogons have already been removed :-}.

1. Switch on the power switches.
2. If the On-line indicator is on, press the ONLINE switch so the
   indicator goes off.
3. Press the WRT EN/TEST switch.
4. Press the DENSITY SELECT switch.
5. Press the LOAD/REWIND switch. 
6. Press the WRT EN/TEST switch.
7. Press the UNLOAD switch.
8. Press the DENSITY SELECT switch.  The alphhanumeric display now
   displays the message UNIT (Unit Address).
9. Press the ONLINE switch to enter the Change Mode.
10. Press switch LOAD/REWIND or UNLOAD to step to the
    next parameter value.
11. Press the ONLINE switch to enter the parameter value (no),
    and return the drive to the Review Mode.
12. Press and hold the WRT EN TEST switch and then press the
    DENSITY SELECT switch to save the new setting in non-volatile
    memory and exit the service aid.  The message SAVING appears  
    on the display.
 

