Use the "disklabel" command to relabel disk.
Use the "newfs" command to format partitions.
Use the "mount" to mount partitions.
Add mount options to /etc/fstab to automatically mount at boot.

Remember that the scsi address on a external disk is plus 8!
DKB100 will be device rz9.
