Don't use cdwrite, it is dead for more than 2 and a half year.
Cdwrite is close to absolutely non-portable too.

Cdrecord is highly portable and maintained. Cdrecord currently runs on

SunOS 4.x
SunOS 5.x (SOlaris)
Linux
FreeBSD / NetBSD / OpenBSD
SGI-IRIX
IBM-AIX
HP-UX
Next STep
Apple Rhapsody

There are unofficial ports to VMS, OSF1 & Ultrix. The Ultrix port is not yet
available on the net, it has been made by a guy in a bank in Berlin.
I met him seome weeks ago but forgot his email address :-(

